# Patch files are matched byte-for-byte by `git apply` against a freshly
# checked-out DPF source tree. Never let git normalize their line endings
# on checkout (Windows' default core.autocrlf=true would convert them to
# CRLF, which is what caused windows-latest CI's "corrupt patch" failure
# applying dpf-clap-activate-latency.patch) or on commit.
cmake/patches/*.patch -text
